title: An Advertising Agency
tags: event
view-if: time >= 3 and time <= 6 and saatchi_hired = 0
max-visits: 1
new-page: true

= An Advertising Agency

Gordon Reece wants to hire a young advertising agency, Saatchi & Saatchi, to run our campaigns. They would be the first agency to treat a British party like a brand. Some of the old guard think it's vulgar.

- @hire: Hire them.
- @decline: Stick with the traditional approach.

@hire
subtitle: -2 resources
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Requires 2 resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; saatchi_hired = 1; thatcher_rating += 1
achievement: saatchi

Saatchi & Saatchi take the account. Their first question is what the voters want, not what the party wants to tell them.

@decline
on-arrival: wet_dissent -= 1

Party political broadcasts will carry on as before: a minister behind a desk, explaining.
